### Local machine configuration ###
# Contains absolute paths from whoever ran the build (its own header says it must
# never be committed). Nothing in this repo reads it -- Katalyst has no Android/SDK
# dependency -- but IDEs recreate it anyway, so keep it ignored rather than deleted.
local.properties

### Stray Gradle / JVM output ###
# Daemon diagnostics and OOM heap dumps land in whatever directory the build ran from.
gradle-info.log
*.hprof

